  m_text: 'AED PRACTICE

    for emergencies


    1. Make an emergency call

    2.
    Fetch the AED and place it next to the patient

    3. Turn on the AED

    4.
    Apply the pads correctly. Wait for feedback.


    Don''t lose too much time!
    :)'
